msgstr "Uji bahawa pengesahan JWT berfungsi dengan betul"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Failed to save SSO test status"
msgstr "Gagal menyimpan status ujian SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Try logging in with SSO. Did it work?"
msgstr "Cuba log masuk dengan SSO. Berjaya?"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "To check if JWT authentication was configured successfully, open Metabase in a different browser or in a private tab and try logging in to your account using single sign-on (SSO). Is login working correctly?"
msgstr "Untuk menyemak sama ada pengesahan JWT telah dikonfigurasi dengan berjaya, buka Metabase dalam pelayar lain atau dalam tab peribadi dan cuba log masuk ke akaun anda menggunakan log masuk tunggal (SSO). Adakah log masuk berfungsi dengan betul?"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "No, I couldn't log in"
msgstr "Tidak, saya tidak dapat log masuk"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Log in works, I'm done"
msgstr "Log masuk berfungsi, saya selesai"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Penyelesaian masalah"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Try the steps below before testing JWT authentication again. If nothing works, consider contacting support."
msgstr "Cuba langkah di bawah sebelum menguji pengesahan JWT sekali lagi. Jika tiada yang berjaya, pertimbangkan untuk menghubungi sokongan."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "404 error after SSO sign-in"
msgstr "Ralat 404 selepas log masuk SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after clicking on \"Sign in with SSO\", the browser returns a 404 error, make sure the value of the JWT SSO URI in admin settings / auth / JWT is pointing to your endpoint and your endpoint is up and running and available."
msgstr "Jika selepas mengklik pada \"Sign in with SSO\", pelayar memulangkan ralat 404, pastikan nilai JWT SSO URI dalam tetapan pentadbir / auth / JWT menunjuk ke endpoint anda dan endpoint anda sedang berjalan serta boleh diakses."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "JWT decryption error: \"Message seems corrupt\""
msgstr "Ralat nyahsulit JWT: \"Message seems corrupt\""

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\" there was an issue decrypting signed JWT. Ensure METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET has the right value."
msgstr "Jika selepas diubah hala dari aplikasi anda ke Metabase, anda melihat \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\", terdapat isu menyahsulit JWT yang ditandatangani. Pastikan METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET mempunyai nilai yang betul."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Tenant ID mismatch error"
msgstr "Ralat ketidakpadanan ID Penyewa"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", your application is trying to sign in a the user with the wrong tenant slug. Review @tenant claim in the JWT and ensure it matches the tenant this tenant user belongs to."
msgstr "Jika selepas diubah hala dari aplikasi anda ke Metabase, anda melihat mesej ralat \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", aplikasi anda sedang cuba log masuk pengguna dengan slug penyewa yang salah. Semak claim @tenant dalam JWT dan pastikan ia sepadan dengan penyewa yang pengguna penyewa ini miliki."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "User provisioning disabled for JWT SSO"
msgstr "Peruntukan pengguna dilumpuhkan untuk JWT SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication. Either turn this feature on to have users be provisioned if they don't exist yet, or ensure users exist before signing them in via JWT SSO."
msgstr "Jika selepas diubah hala dari aplikasi anda ke Metabase, anda melihat mesej ralat \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication. Either turn this feature on to have users be provisioned if they don't exist yet, or ensure users exist before signing them in via JWT SSO.\", ini kerana peruntukan pengguna dimatikan untuk JWT SSO dalam tetapan pentadbir/pengesahan. Sama ada hidupkan ciri ini supaya pengguna diperuntukkan jika mereka belum wujud, atau pastikan pengguna wujud sebelum melog masuk mereka melalui JWT SSO."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Contact customer support"
msgstr "Hubungi sokongan pelanggan"

