msgstr "Sama ada item yang baru dilihat oleh pengguna disertakan dalam prompt sistem Metabot."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Invalid Azure model {0}. Expected format: <connection>/<family>/<deployment-name> where <family> is one of: {1}"
msgstr "Model Azure {0} tidak sah. Format dijangka: <connection>/<family>/<deployment-name> di mana <family> ialah salah satu daripada: {1}"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Unsupported model {0} for Metabase managed AI. Supported models: {1}"
msgstr "Model {0} tidak disokong untuk AI terurus Metabase. Model yang disokong: {1}"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Metabot provider must be a string, got: {0}"
msgstr "Provider Metabot mesti berupa string, diterima: {0}"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Model name is required. Expected format: connection/model, e.g. \"anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5\""
msgstr "Nama model diperlukan. Format dijangka: connection/model, contohnya \"anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5\""

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model for Metabot. Format: connection-key/model-name, e.g. `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5.4`, `openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`. The connection key names an entry in the `llm-providers` setting and defaults to the provider type."
msgstr "Sambungan provider AI dan model untuk Metabot. Format: connection-key/model-name, contohnya `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5.4`, `openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`. Kunci sambungan menamakan entri dalam tetapan `llm-providers` dan lalai kepada jenis provider."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model used for quick background tasks, such as naming Metabot conversations, in the same connection-key/model-name format as `llm-metabot-provider`. Defaults to the fastest model offered by the connection Metabot runs on."
msgstr "Sambungan provider AI dan model yang digunakan untuk tugasan latar belakang yang pantas, seperti menamakan perbualan Metabot, dalam format connection-key/model-name yang sama seperti `llm-metabot-provider`. Lalai kepada model terpantas yang ditawarkan oleh sambungan yang digunakan Metabot."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Number of days to retain rows in the ai_usage_log, metabot_conversation, and metabot_message tables. Minimum value is 30; set to 0 to retain data indefinitely."
msgstr "Bilangan hari untuk mengekalkan baris dalam jadual ai_usage_log, metabot_conversation, dan metabot_message. Nilai minimum ialah 30; tetapkan kepada 0 untuk mengekalkan data tanpa had masa."

