#: metabase_enterprise/data_complexity_score/settings.clj
msgid "Deprecated: the :data-complexity-score premium feature token is the authoritative gate for the scheduled scoring job. Retained as a read-only fallback so existing overrides keep working — values from the MB_DATA_COMPLEXITY_SCORING_ENABLED env var or previously persisted DB rows are still honored, but the setting can no longer be changed at runtime."
msgstr "Tidak digunakan lagi: token ciri premium :data-complexity-score ialah pengawal berautoriti untuk kerja pemarkahan berjadual. Dikekalkan sebagai fallback baca sahaja supaya override sedia ada terus berfungsi — nilai daripada env var MB_DATA_COMPLEXITY_SCORING_ENABLED atau baris DB yang disimpan sebelum ini masih dihormati, tetapi tetapan ini tidak lagi boleh diubah semasa runtime."

